# Plan Execution Model

When executing a plan (implementing a plan file, running Plan Mode output, or
launching a Task subagent to carry out multi-step work), default to the
**Composer** model (`composer-2.5-fast`) for that execution.

- Only use a different model if the user explicitly specifies one for that
  task (e.g. "use Claude for this" or a named model in their message).
- This applies to plan *execution*, not necessarily to lighter conversational
  turns (e.g. answering questions, quick lookups) unless the user says otherwise.
